<div class="py-8 lg:py-10 max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) mx-auto px-4">
  <%!-- Intro Section --%>
  <div class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-3xl mb-12">
    <h1>Board of Directors</h1>

    <p>
      The Board of Directors consists of up to eleven positions with a minimum of nine. In addition to overseeing the day-to-day affairs of the YSC, it also works to develop a vision for the club that reflects current membership needs and keeps the club alive, healthy, relevant and Scandinavian.
    </p>
    <p>
      The YSC is always in need of talented, motivated members to serve on the board and/or the various committees. Annual elections take place at the beginning of each year. You can see the board in action by reviewing our
      <.link
        navigate={~p"/financials"}
        class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors duration-150"
      >
        Financials & Annual Meetings
      </.link>
      page. Regular meeting dates are posted on the
      <a
        href="#board-meeting-schedule"
        class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors duration-150"
      >
        board meeting schedule
      </a>
      below.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- Two Column Layout — wider member list, narrower “Help shape…” sidebar --%>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-12 lg:gap-14 lg:items-start">
    <%!-- Left Column: Active Board Members --%>
    <div
      :if={@bod_members != []}
      class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-none w-full min-w-0"
    >
      <h2>Current Board Members</h2>
      <div class="not-prose">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <%= for member <- @bod_members do %>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-5 p-6 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl bg-white hover:border-zinc-300 transition-colors duration-200 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6">
              <.user_avatar_image
                user={member}
                size={:large}
                class="h-64 w-64 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto sm:mx-0"
              />
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 w-full text-center sm:text-left">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">
                  {member.first_name} {member.last_name}
                </h3>
                <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium mt-1">
                  {titleize(member.board_position)}
                </p>
                <%= if String.trim(Map.get(member, :board_bio) || "") != "" do %>
                  <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">
                    {String.trim(Map.get(member, :board_bio, ""))}
                  </p>
                <% else %>
                  <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
                    Board bio coming soon.
                  </p>
                <% end %>
              </div>
            </div>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- Right Column: Join the Board / Get Involved --%>
    <div
      :if={@bod_members != []}
      class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-none w-full min-w-0 lg:max-w-md lg:justify-self-end"
    >
      <div class="p-6 lg:p-7 bg-blue-50 rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 h-fit sticky top-8">
        <div class="prose prose-zinc max-w-none mb-6">
          <h2>Help Shape the Future of YSC</h2>
          <%= if not Enum.empty?(@vacant_positions) do %>
            <p>
              We are currently looking for passionate members to fill the following roles. Annual elections take place at the beginning of each year, and we welcome inquiries year-round.
            </p>
          <% else %>
            <p>
              All board positions are currently filled—thank you to our dedicated directors! The club still thrives on member involvement beyond the board itself.
            </p>
            <p>
              Serve on a committee, volunteer at events and cabins, or let us know you're interested in next year's elections. We welcome inquiries year-round.
            </p>
          <% end %>
        </div>
        <%= if not Enum.empty?(@vacant_positions) do %>
          <div class="not-prose space-y-4">
            <%= for position <- @vacant_positions do %>
              <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-100 hover:border-zinc-200 transition-colors duration-200">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-4">
                  <div class="flex-1">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-1">
                      {titleize(position)}
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600">
                      <%= case position do %>
                        <% :president -> %>
                          Lead the organization and set strategic direction for the club.
                        <% :vice_president -> %>
                          Support the President and step in when needed.
                        <% :secretary -> %>
                          Manage board meetings, minutes, and official documentation.
                        <% :treasurer -> %>
                          Oversee financial operations and budgeting.
                        <% :tahoe_cabin_master -> %>
                          Oversee the maintenance and magic of our mountain retreat.
                        <% :clear_lake_cabin_master -> %>
                          Manage our Clear Lake cabin and coordinate bookings.
                        <% :event_director -> %>
                          Plan and coordinate club events and activities.
                        <% :member_outreach -> %>
                          Connect with members and build community engagement.
                        <% :membership_director -> %>
                          Manage membership applications and member relations.
                        <% _ -> %>
                          Help guide the club's vision and operations.
                      <% end %>
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <.link
                    navigate={
                      ~p"/contact?subject=Board of Directors&message=#{URI.encode("Hi, I'm interested in the #{titleize(position)} position on the YSC Board of Directors. I'd love to learn more about the role and how I can contribute.")}"
                    }
                    class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-600 hover:underline whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 ml-4 transition-colors duration-150"
                  >
                    Inquire<.icon
                      name="hero-arrow-right-solid"
                      class="w-4 h-4 -mt-0.5 inline-block ms-1"
                    />
                  </.link>
                </div>
              </div>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <div class="not-prose space-y-3">
            <.link
              navigate={~p"/volunteer"}
              class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-100 hover:border-zinc-200 transition-colors duration-200 group"
            >
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-1">
                  Volunteer with the YSC
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600">
                  Help with events, cabins, outreach, and more—the club is 100% volunteer-led.
                </p>
              </div>
              <.icon
                name="hero-arrow-right-solid"
                class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-blue-600 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform duration-150"
              />
            </.link>
            <.link
              navigate={
                ~p"/contact?subject=Board of Directors&message=#{URI.encode("Hi, I'd like to learn more about getting involved with the YSC—whether on a committee or in a future board election.")}"
              }
              class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-100 hover:border-zinc-200 transition-colors duration-200 group"
            >
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-1">
                  Contact the Board
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600">
                  Ask about committees, future elections, or other ways to contribute.
                </p>
              </div>
              <.icon
                name="hero-arrow-right-solid"
                class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-blue-600 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform duration-150"
              />
            </.link>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Board Meeting Schedule (bylaws §5.11: regular meetings follow a publicly posted schedule) --%>
  <div
    id="board-meeting-schedule"
    class="border-t border-zinc-100 mt-12 pt-12 lg:mt-14"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 shrink-0">
        <.icon name="hero-calendar" class="w-5 h-5" />
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
        Board Meeting Schedule
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-3xl mb-6">
      <p>
        Regular meetings of the Board of Directors follow the schedule below, which also includes the Annual Meeting. Section 5.11 of the
        <.link
          navigate={~p"/bylaws"}
          class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors duration-150"
        >
          bylaws
        </.link>
        covers how regular and special meetings are noticed.
      </p>
      <p id="board-meeting-attendance">
        Any member of the club is welcome to attend a regular board meeting. Please email
        <.link href="mailto:board@ysc.org">board@ysc.org</.link>
        beforehand to let us know you're coming, so we can make sure you're admitted to the building. All board meetings are held at the Swedish American Hall, 2174 Market St, San Francisco, CA 94114.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-200">
      <iframe
        id="board-meeting-calendar"
        src="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=c_d621b3a4fc0326de60ed10ce25ca45e0c5c818f9947b1ebb4f5a71311f61963c%40group.calendar.google.com&ctz=America%2FLos_Angeles"
        class="w-full border-0"
        height="600"
        frameborder="0"
        scrolling="no"
        title="YSC Board Meeting Schedule"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
